@startuml Saga_DeliveryFailed
title Saga-хореография: ошибка доставки → возврат средств и освобождение резерва

participant "Event Bus" as Bus
participant "Delivery Service" as Delivery
participant "Order Service" as Order
participant "Payment Service" as Payment
participant "Inventory Service" as Inventory
participant "Notification Service" as Notify
participant "Покупатель" as Customer

== Предыдущие шаги: PaymentSucceeded → OrderConfirmed ==

Bus -> Delivery: OrderConfirmed
activate Delivery
Delivery -> Delivery: Попытка создать заявку в логистике
Delivery -> Bus: **DeliveryScheduleFailed**
deactivate Delivery

Bus -> Order: DeliveryScheduleFailed
activate Order
Order -> Order: Статус → CANCELLED
Order -> Bus: **OrderCancelled**
deactivate Order

Bus -> Payment: OrderCancelled
activate Payment
Payment -> Payment: Вернуть средства
Payment -> Bus: **RefundSucceeded** (compensation)
deactivate Payment

Bus -> Inventory: OrderCancelled
activate Inventory
Inventory -> Inventory: Освободить резерв
Inventory -> Bus: **InventoryReleased** (compensation)
deactivate Inventory

Bus -> Notify: OrderCancelled
activate Notify
Notify -> Customer: Push: «Заказ отменён: проблема с доставкой, средства возвращены»
deactivate Notify
@enduml